    "18second original silent portrait montage demo is clearly labeled not an advertisement. Video must play through, early close earns nothing, hidden page pauses, seek/rate guards and3/day local sandbox limit. This is not real AdMob or tamper-proof client reward authority. Real rewards require authenticated server SSV. Video is pinned/SHA-verified and cached for offline reuse.",
