    "51Node tests pass (8commerce,5platform/ledger,38existing). Browser confirms opt-in, cancel with no grant, packs/player/frame/recovery/premium/daily/cancel, real18s demo playback reward and early-close no reward, four viewport shop fits, full offline save/video; legacy shop/transfer/facility/offline flow passes. Android Gradle AAR compile succeeds. No physical-device billing/AdMob/internal-track or FPS claim.",
    "No maps/geometry/audio/portrait art/core club coin balance changed. Protected28published+209parent files and working case bot preserved. No new installable gameAPK, real payment enablement, real ad requests, financial server authority or source-map rights clearance. Main scope remix31 plus original18redirect only.",
    "Source /dev/shm/arena-manager-commerce45, build /dev/shm/arena-manager-commerce45-web, evidence /dev/shm/arena-commerce45-tests, RAMGit /dev/shm/arena-pages32. Durable source ZIP and receipt on arena-commerce45-source; demo media on arena-commerce45-media. Gradle distribution/cache in /dev/shm/arena-gradle45, existing SDK/JDK read from /workspace/.arena-tools; no user assets deleted. Keep inheritedproxy/TLS and do not move persistent old Git refs to RAM-only objects. Overlay full; direct github.io blocked, exact Pages Success confirms deployment."
